Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 26
Set Width 1400
Set Height 1260
Set Padding 36
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Hide
Type `clear && bin/ruby-wordle solve`
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Show
Type "crane yxxyg"
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Type "niche yxyxg"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Screenshot img/solve.png
Sleep 500ms
